{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Push this button."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2920,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's driving itself. It feels good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8333,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, BMW brought me to the Consumer\nElectornics Show here in Las Vegas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13233,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to check out\nthe future of driving."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17500,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did I get it? Am I near?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19467,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[unintelligible]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20367,
    "dDurationMs": 1666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh! I felt it!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23400,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That really felt like pushing a button."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25767,
    "dDurationMs": 2966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this concept car, there's\na holographic menu screen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28733,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It works by projecting an\nimage above this panel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32000,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then it uses this camera in the\nstreering column to determine where"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35300,
    "dDurationMs": 967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your finger is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36267,
    "dDurationMs": 2466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when it detects your\nfingers in the right spot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38733,
    "dDurationMs": 4167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it uses ultrasound from these \nspeakers to provide haptic feedback -"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42900,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can actually feel it in your fingers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45033,
    "dDurationMs": 1534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like a little buzzing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47033,
    "dDurationMs": 3134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what I really want\nto try is NOT driving."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50167,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can actually talk to the camera."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52267,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are you sure that this is a good idea?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54900,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here's a question:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56500,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How much should you\ntrust an autonomous car?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59067,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This car is now driving itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61667,
    "dDurationMs": 3166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I need to be able to\ntake over at any time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64880,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm still legally reponsible if \nsomething happens to the car, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69200,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, in the coming years, cars are\ngoing to take over more and more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73167,
    "dDurationMs": 2366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the responsibility for driving safely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75533,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that has led a lot of people to\n consider the moral dilemmas faced"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79133,
    "dDurationMs": 1967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when programming self-driving cars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81100,
    "dDurationMs": 4133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The question is what sort of ethical\nframework should we program in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85233,
    "dDurationMs": 1434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through autonomous vehicles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86667,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it needs to make a decision."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88767,
    "dDurationMs": 4733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Swerve left into an SUV or\nswerve right into a motorcycle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95000,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so we can imagine a lot of weird\nsituations where an autonomous car"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99400,
    "dDurationMs": 1267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has to make a tough choice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100667,
    "dDurationMs": 3566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the real moral dilema is\naccidents are happening right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104233,
    "dDurationMs": 3767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "More than 30,000 people are\nkilled each year in the U.S. alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108000,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And more than 2 million are injured."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110233,
    "dDurationMs": 4234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the problem in 94%\nof collisions is driver error."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114467,
    "dDurationMs": 4933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 2015, half of all traffic\nfatalities occurred on highways."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119400,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So even this level of technology\nwe've demonstrated today -"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122533,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "autonomous driving on a highway - \ncould save a lot of lives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127840,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are already shirking our\nresponsibility for driving cars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131100,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are using our phones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133133,
    "dDurationMs": 6267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 2014, distracted driving resulted in at\nleast 3,000 killed 430,000 injured."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139400,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, if we're not driving, we better \nhope that the tech gets to a level"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143367,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the cars can drive for us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144967,
    "dDurationMs": 3066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My view: this problem is\nonly going to get worse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148733,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, when elevators\nbecame autonomous,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151800,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a lot of people were\nuncomfortable with that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154367,
    "dDurationMs": 3433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were used to there\nbeing a driver in the elevator,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157800,
    "dDurationMs": 4167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so compromises had to be made,\nlike big red stop buttons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161967,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just to make people comfortable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163367,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And a nice soothing voice to say \n\"Which floor would you like to go to?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167300,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, I know that elevators have many\nfewer degrees of freedom"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171233,
    "dDurationMs": 3634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than a car, but even if you look at\nsomething like airplanes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175300,
    "dDurationMs": 4933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "airplanes flying in full autonomous mode\nare actually safer - studies show -"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180233,
    "dDurationMs": 2267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than when pilots can take control."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182500,
    "dDurationMs": 4667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think the moral dilemmas over exactly \nhow cars should react in a tiny percentage"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187167,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of cases where tough\nchoices need to be made"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189067,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is a distraction from the main problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191700,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The longer we wait to get\nautonomous vehicles on the road,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194667,
    "dDurationMs": 1633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the more people will die."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196300,
    "dDurationMs": 3867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is the real moral\nquestion of autonomous cars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200167,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why aren't we getting\nthem on the road faster?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203067,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I hope you enjoyed the ride."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205467,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was cool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206067,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now let's head back for the CES."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208500,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Perfect."
    } ]
  } ]
}
